          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Animals can be musical partners as much as the subjects or audience. Your animal companion becomes trained in Performance (or expert if it was already trained). When you cast a composition spell, you can have it originate either from you or from your animal companion, if your animal companion is within 30 feet of you.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 12
